<title>HONG KONG: Korea Exchange Bank HK sets HK$ FRCD.</title>
<headline>Korea Exchange Bank HK sets HK$ FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by Chase Manhattan Asia.</p>
<p>BORROWER KOREA EXCHANGE BANK HONG KONG BRANCH</p>
<p> AMOUNT   HK$500 MLN  COUPON     1MH+30 BP  MATURITY  364 DAYS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	  ISS PRICE  PAR	  RE-OFFER  99.975</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	  CALLS	NONE	 LAUNCH    02.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING  --	    REPAYMENT  BULLET     REPLIES   02.SEP.96</p>
<p> RATING   --	    SALES LMTS STANDARD   DENOMS    HK$1 MLN</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	   CRS DEF    YES	  FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW  HONG KONG   HOME CTRY  HONG KONG  PAY DATE  23.SEP.96</p>
<p> FEES     7.5 BP	PRAECIPIUM 2.5 BP</p>
<p>LEAD MANAGER CHASE MANHATTAN ASIA, JARDINE FLEMING, SAKURA</p>
<p>		  FINANCE ASIA</p>
<p>--HK Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
